#: kcmaccess.cpp:60
msgid "Audible Bell"
msgstr "Słyšomny zwónčk"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:67
msgid "Use &system bell"
msgstr "Wužiwaj &systemowy zwónčk"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:69
msgid "Us&e customized bell"
msgstr "Wužiwaj &postajeny zwónčk"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:71
msgid ""
"If this option is checked, the default system bell will be used. See the "
"\"System Bell\" control module for how to customize the system bell. "
"Normally, this is just a \"beeep\"."
msgstr ""
"Hdyž je tuta opcija wubrana, wužiwa so standardny systemowy zwónčk. Pohladajće "
"do kontrolneho modula \"Systemowy zwónčk\", zo byšće zhonił, kak so systemowy zwónčk "
"konfiguruje. Zwjetša je to proste piwčenje."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:74
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want to use a customized bell, playing a sound "
"file. If you do this, you will probably want to turn off the system bell.<p> "
"Please note that on slow machines this may cause a \"lag\" between the event "
"causing the bell and the sound being played."
msgstr ""
"Wubjerće tutu opciju, chceće-li jako zwónčk zwukowu dataju wothrać. Jeli to "
"činiće, dyrbiće najskerje systemowy zwónčk hasnyć.<p> "
"Prošu wopomńće, zo móhło to na pomałym computeru přestawka nastać mjez "
"podawkom, kiž je zwónčk wuwołał, a wothrawanjom zwuka."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:81
msgid "Sound &to play:"
msgstr "Zwuk, kiž ma so &hrać:"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:86
msgid ""
"If the option \"Use customized bell\" is enabled, you can choose a sound "
"file here. Click \"Browse...\" to choose a sound file using the file dialog."
msgstr ""
"Hdyž je opcija \"Konfigurowany zwónčk wužiwać\" zaswěćena, móžeće tu zwukowu "
"dataju wubrać. Klikńće na \"Přelistować...\", zo byšće z datajowym dialogom zwukowu "
"dataju wubrali."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:103
msgid "Visible Bell"
msgstr "Widźomny zwónčk"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:109
msgid "&Use visible bell"
msgstr "&Wužiwaj wizuelny zwónčk"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:111
msgid ""
"This option will turn on the \"visible bell\", i.e. a visible notification "
"shown every time that normally just a bell would occur. This is especially "
"useful for deaf people."
msgstr ""
"Tuta opcija zaswěći \"wizuelny zwónčk\", t.r. zo so wužiwar optisce na něšto skedźbnja, "
"na čož by so hewak ze zwónčkom skedźbnił. To je hłuchim wosebje wužitne."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:117
msgid "I&nvert screen"
msgstr "Wobrazowku &inwertować"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:120
msgid "All screen colors will be inverted for the amount of time specified below."
msgstr "Wšě barby na wobrazowce so na deleka specifikowany čas inwertuja."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:122
msgid "F&lash screen"
msgstr "Wobrazowka &zabłysknje"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:124
msgid ""
"The screen will turn to a custom color for the amount of time specified "
"below."
msgstr "Wobrazowka na deleka specifikowany čas konfigurowanu barbu přiwozmje. "

#: kcmaccess.cpp:130
msgid "Click here to choose the color used for the \"flash screen\" visible bell."
msgstr "Klikńće tu, zo byšće barbu za wizuelny zwónčk \"Wobrazowka zabłysknje\" wubrali."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:137
msgid "Duration:"
msgstr "Kak dołho:"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:138 kcmaccess.cpp:191 kcmaccess.cpp:209
msgid " msec"
msgstr "msek"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:140
msgid ""
"Here you can customize the duration of the \"visible bell\" effect being "
"shown."
msgstr "Tu móžeće nastajić, kak dołho ma efekt \"wizuelneho zwónčka\" trać."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:157
msgid "&Bell"
msgstr "&Zwónčk"

